{"id":"king-s-wing","name":{"en":"King's Wing","ja":"王者の翼","sc":"王者之翼","tc":"王者之翼"},"desc":{"en":"The wing of a dragon, capable of flight. It's large enough to cast a vast shadow over the desert, and treasure hunters are always on alert for such shadows when traveling.","ja":"飛翔能力を持つドラゴンの翼。その大きさは砂漠に日陰を作るほどで、トレジャーハンターたちはこの動く日陰を常に警戒して動き回っている"},"level":18,"slots":3,"evalue":40,"wind":true,"effect":90,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"geofront","name":{"en":"Geofront","ja":"ジオフロント"},"parent":"baskes-region"}],"categories":[{"id":"dragon-material","name":{"en":"(Dragon Material)","ja":"（竜素材）"},"icon":"category-dragon-material"},{"id":"feather","name":{"en":"(Feather)","ja":"（羽根）"},"icon":"category-feather"},{"id":"meat","name":{"en":"(Meat)","ja":"（肉）"},"icon":"category-meat"},{"id":"pelt","name":{"en":"(Pelt)","ja":"（皮）"},"icon":"category-pelt"}],"index":118,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_KINGS_WING"}